* Opamp inverting golden ngspice reference (VCCS twin of .model OA(AOL=200000 ROUT=1))
* Correct polarity: G element I(n+ -> n-) = gm*V(nc+,nc-), so
* `G1 out 0 vminus 0 200000` injects Gm*(0 - V(vminus)) INTO out (V+ = ground).
.OPTIONS INTERP reltol=1e-4
VMLG in_mlg 0 PWL({PWL})
RMLG in_mlg in 1
R1 in vminus 1k
R2 vminus out 10k
G1 out 0 vminus 0 200000
Rout out 0 1
{TRAN}
.control
run
wrdata {DAT} v(out)
.endc
.END
